{
  "title": "(d) Fifteenth of Rajab (Namaz e Salman)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "It is recommended to offer the famous Salat Salman (The Prayer of Salman al-Farisi), which consists of thirty units:\nOn the first of Rajab, ten units are offered (in sets of two). In each unit, recite [Surah al-Fatihah](A5) once, [Surah al-Tawhid](A116) three times, and [Surah al-Kafirun](A113) three times.\nOn the fifteenth of Rajab, another ten units are offered with the same surahs.\nAfter concluding the prayer on the fifteenth, raise your hands towards the sky and say:\nلَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ وَحْدَهٗ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ لَهُ الْمُلْكُ وَ لَهُ الْحَمْدُ يُحْيِيْ وَ يُمِيْتُ وَ هُوَ حَيٌّ لَّا يَمُوْتُ بِيَدِهِ الْخَيْرُ وَ هُوَ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيْرٌ\nLAA ILAAHA ILLALLAAHU WAHDAHOO LAA SHAREEKA LAH, LAHUL MULKU WA LAHUL HAMDU YUHYEE WA YUMEETU WA HUWA HAYYUL LAA YAMOOTU BI-YADIHIL KHAYRU WA HUWA A'LAA KULLI SHAY-IN QADEER\nThere is no god save Allah, alone without partner. His is the kingdom and His is the praise; He gives life and causes death, and He is Ever-living and does not die; in His hand is all good, and He has power over all things.\nاِلٰهًا وَاحِدًا اَحَدًا صَمَدًا فَرْدًا لَّمْ يَتَّخِذْ صَاحِبَةً وَّ لَا وَلَدًا\nILAAHAN WAAHIDAN AHADAN SAMADAN FARDAL LAM YATTAKHIDH SAHIBATAN WA LAA WALADAA\nOne, Single, Besought of all, Unique God; He has taken neither a consort nor a son."
}
